 accusation is part of the game, so there's no real harm in submitting the letter. Under causal decision theory the other copy's choice is independent of mine, and sending gives a better payoff either way (0 versus 2, and 4 versus 5), so I'm going with submit.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9706,"completion_tokens":530,"total_tokens":10236,"cost":0.049424,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.049424,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.038824,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0106},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":95,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}